        "topic": "grammar",
        "title": "Questions and negatives with do",
        "body": "Most verbs need the helper do (does, did) to make questions and negatives; the main verb goes back to its base form. Be, modal verbs (can, must, will…) and other helpers (have in perfect tenses) swap places with the subject instead.",
